WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:08,820
Let's make your progress. The ghost doctor is here.

2
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:09,900
Are you trying to harm us?

3
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,060
You trapper

4
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:21,180
If you want to play in a haunted house so much, she will be annoyed by it.

5
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:29,680
Why is the ghost doctor running so slowly? He’s so difficult for humans to deal with.

6
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,160
He was stabbed by a human

7
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,240
God helps us too

8
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,900
It's hard for me to control my temper now

9
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,980
I need to solve a personal problem first

10
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,800
If you don't stop

11
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:42,480
I'll take care of you first and keep this human being in pain.

12
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,760
You don’t need any props to hurt me.

13
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,240
And she seems to be angry. I have a hunch.

14
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,760
Whoever goes up now will die

15
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,320
Ordinary humans have little strength

16
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,360
Can't hurt us at all

17
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,810
Must have special abilities

18
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:53,890
This kind of prey is not something we can try

19
00:00:53,890 --> 00:00:55,210
Leave it to my colleagues on the fifth floor.

20
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:57,770
Let’s talk about the beginning

21
00:00:57,770 --> 00:01:00,010
Where is the nurse team leader on the third floor who asked us to come up together?

22
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:03,690
Are you hiding?
